API Versioning Strategy
URI versioning (/api/v1/, /api/v2/) is used over header versioning because it is more visible in logs, curl commands,
and API gateways. A DeprecationService writes a Deprecation: true response header and a Sunset: <date> header for
6 months before a version is removed.
