8. Risks & Mitigations
Risk
Kafka consumer lag spike
Impact
Mitigation
Reconciliation delays beyond window TTL
HPA scales pods when lag > 1,000. DLQ captures events after 3 retries. 24 partitions for headroom.
Poison pill messages
Partition halted by repeated consumer exceptions
DefaultErrorHandler with exponential back-off (1s/2s/4s/8s, max 3 retries). Events beyond limit go to DLQ. Alert fires when DLQ depth > 10.
pgvector latency at scale
AI classification latency degrades at > 1M known_issues rows
HNSW m=16, can rebuild offline. LIMIT 3 on similarity search. Soft-delete only to maintain embedding continuity.
PostgreSQL partition proliferation High planning overhead at 1,000+ tenants
LIST (tenant_id) partitioning — queries always hit exactly one partition. Sub-partitioning by month when partition exceeds 100M rows.
Database downtime / failover
Write failures during reconciliation Patroni streaming replica / AWS RDS Multi-AZ. @Retryable(maxAttempts=3). Kafka offsets not committed until DB write succeeds.
